  "body": "Welcome to your perfect seaside escape! This elegant 3 bedrooms, 2.5 bathrooms home offers a harmonious blend of contemporary living and natural beauty. With a well-designed 132sqm (approx.) floor plan set on a 129sqm (approx.) section, this property is ideal for families or anyone seeking a relaxed coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nThe layout is thoughtfully designed to maximize comfort and functionality. A downstairs bedroom provides flexible living options, while two upstairs bedrooms, including the luxurious master suite, offer privacy and tranquility. The master suite boasts a stunning ensuite and its own private balcony with captivating sea views framed by native bush-a serene retreat to unwind after a long day. An additional full bathroom upstairs ensures convenience for everyone.\r\n\r\nThe open-plan living area seamlessly connects the modern kitchen, dining, and lounge spaces, creating a warm and inviting hub for everyday living or entertaining. Step out onto your private deck, which overlooks lush native greenery, perfect for enjoying your morning coffee or hosting a summer barbecue. The low-maintenance garden is an oasis of peace, ideal for quiet relaxation or fun with family and friends.\r\n\r\nEquipped with an efficient heat pump, this home provides year-round comfort, keeping you warm in winter and cool during the summer months.\r\n\r\nLocated just minutes from Orewa's vibrant shopping centers, excellent schools like Nukumea School, and the pristine Orewa Beach, this property offers a lifestyle of convenience and leisure. Everything you need is within easy reach, making it an ideal choice for modern living.\r\n\r\nDon't miss the chance to meet 15B Rockpool Road, Orewa your new home. Contact us today to arrange a viewing and experience this exceptional property for yourself!",
